{"surah":108,"ayahs":["إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">نَّآ</span> أَعْطَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>كَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَوْثَرَ","فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>نْحَرْ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> شَانِئَكَ هُوَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>تَرُ"]}